OL,3,AFBI arrests woman over alleged plot to
OL,4,Abomb New York capitol building
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe FBI has arrested a New York woman
OL,7,Fwho was allegedly planning to bomb the
OL,8,Fstate capitol building in Albany to
OL,9,Fkill lawmakers.
OL,11,FProsecutors allege that Jessica Bowie,
OL,12,F35, had previously pledged allegiance
OL,13,Fto the Islamic State group (IS). She is
OL,14,Fcharged with providing material support
OL,15,For resources to a designated foreign
OL,16,Fterrorist organisation.
OL,18,FBowie had "repeatedly surveilled the
OL,19,Fbuilding" in advance, and was carrying
OL,20,Fa fake bomb and a defective gun, which
OL,21,Fhad been supplied to her by undercover
OL,22,Fagents, prosecutors said.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
