OL,3,AFBI arrests woman over alleged plot to
OL,4,Abomb New York capitol building
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I want to destroy as much of the
OL,7,Fbuilding as possible and kill the
OL,8,Fsenators," Bowie allegedly told the
OL,9,Fagents, according to the criminal
OL,10,Fcomplaint.
